  "Changes apply straight away and are kept for next time. Rest the pointer on a setting to read what it does.": "更改会立即生效并保留到下次。将指针停在某项设置上即可查看其作用。",
  "The language of the menus and windows. A change takes effect the next time HyperPDF starts.": "菜单和窗口的语言。更改在下次启动 HyperPDF 时生效。",
  "The colours of the window. Calm is soft and low in glare. High contrast gives the strongest difference between words and background.": "窗口的颜色。“平静”柔和且少眩光。“高对比度”让文字与背景的差别最大。",
  "What draws the window. Automatic uses the graphics card, or the processor when that cannot be used. Change it only if pages draw wrongly. It takes effect at the next start.": "由什么来绘制窗口。“自动”使用显卡，显卡不可用时使用处理器。仅在页面显示不正确时才更改。下次启动时生效。",
  "The paper and ink colours that pages are shown in. It does not change the file or how it prints.": "页面显示所用的纸张和墨水颜色。不会更改文件，也不影响打印。",
  "The paper colour of the custom page colours.": "自定义页面颜色中的纸张颜色。",
  "The ink colour of the custom page colours.": "自定义页面颜色中的墨水颜色。",
  "The size of the words in menus, bars and windows. It does not change the page.": "菜单、工具栏和窗口中文字的大小。不会改变页面。",
  "Whether tool bar buttons show their names beside their icons.": "工具栏按钮是否在图标旁显示名称。",
  "Whether zooming glides or jumps straight to the new size. Reduced jumps.": "缩放是平滑过渡还是直接跳到新大小。“减弱”为直接跳转。",
  "Whether the text cursor blinks or stays steady.": "文本光标是闪烁还是保持不动。",
  "How large a document is when it first opens.": "文档首次打开时的显示大小。",
  "What happens when another program saves over a file that is open here.": "其他程序覆盖保存此处已打开的文件时如何处理。",
  "Opens a document at the page you were on when you last closed it.": "在上次关闭时所在的页面打开文档。",
  "Lets a document choose the page it opens at.": "让文档自行决定打开时显示的页面。",
  "Lets a document choose the side panel it opens with, such as its bookmarks.": "让文档自行决定打开时显示的侧边栏，例如书签。",
  "Lets a document choose its page layout and reading direction, such as two pages side by side.": "让文档自行决定页面布局和阅读方向，例如双页并排。",
  "Shows the title written inside a document on its tab, when the document asks for that.": "当文档要求时，在标签页上显示文档内写入的标题。",
  "Starts the print window with the choices a document asks for.": "按文档要求的选项打开打印窗口。",
  "Opens documents with a text cursor on the page, which the keyboard moves.": "打开文档时在页面上显示可用键盘移动的文本光标。",
  "Underlines misspelled words as you type in forms and notes.": "在表单和备注中输入时为拼写错误的词加下划线。",
  "Shows every bookmark in the window's own text colour, whatever colour the document gives it.": "所有书签都用窗口自身的文字颜色显示，不采用文档指定的颜色。",
  "While presenting, plays the page change effects a document asks for.": "演示时播放文档要求的翻页效果。",
  "While presenting, moves to the next page by itself after the time a page asks for.": "演示时按页面要求的时间自动翻到下一页。",
  "Offers fonts for typing that show on screen but cannot be saved in a PDF.": "提供可在屏幕上显示但无法保存到 PDF 的输入字体。",
  "The colour that marks the fields of a form you can fill in.": "用于标记可填写表单域的颜色。",
  "How strongly the fields of a form are marked. Off shows no mark.": "表单域标记的明显程度。“关”表示不标记。",
  "The name written on notes you add. Empty uses this computer's user name.": "写在你添加的备注上的名字。留空则使用本机的用户名。",
  "A ready-made set of the sharpness choices below. Custom means the choices below match no set.": "下方清晰度选项的一组预设。“自定义”表示下方选项与任何预设都不相符。",
  "How the edges of letters are drawn. Smooth blends them into the page. Sharp makes each pixel fully dark or fully clear.": "字母边缘的绘制方式。“平滑”使其与页面融合。“锐利”使每个像素要么全黑要么全透明。",
  "Moves the strokes of small letters onto whole pixels, so they look firmer.": "把小字的笔画对齐到整像素，使其看起来更扎实。",
  "How much darker small text is drawn.": "小号文字加深显示的程度。",
  "Moves thin lines onto whole pixels, so they are even and crisp.": "把细线对齐到整像素，使其均匀清晰。",
  "The thinnest a line is drawn, so very thin lines do not vanish.": "线条的最小绘制粗细，以免极细的线消失。",
  "Blends the edges of lines and shapes into the page.": "使线条和形状的边缘与页面融合。",
  "Blends the pixels of a picture that is shown larger or smaller than it is, so it does not look blocky.": "对放大或缩小显示的图片进行像素平滑，避免出现马赛克。",
  "Shrinks a big picture by averaging the pixels each screen pixel covers.": "缩小大图时，对每个屏幕像素所覆盖的像素取平均。",
  "Draws small letters from shapes kept from the last time each was drawn.": "用上次绘制时保留的形状来绘制小字。",
  "The address of a server that adds a trusted time to signatures you make with a certificate. Empty adds none.": "为用证书所做的签名添加可信时间的服务器地址。留空则不添加。",
  "The voice for reading aloud, its speed and its Azure key are in Read Aloud Settings, on the Read Aloud bar and in the Reading Aids menu.": "朗读的语音、速度和 Azure 密钥在“朗读设置”中，可从朗读栏和“阅读辅助”菜单打开。",
  "Read aloud settings": "朗读设置",
  "Read Aloud _Settings…": "朗读设置(_S)…",
  "Choose the voice, how fast it reads and what is marked on the page. Each change is used at once.": "选择语音、朗读速度以及页面上标记的内容。每项更改都会立即生效。",
  "An Azure voice sends the words it reads to your Azure Speech resource. It needs that resource's region and key.": "Azure 语音会把朗读的文字发送到你的 Azure Speech 资源。需要该资源的区域和密钥。",
